<p>The new template exists as it does due to the input of our (volunteer, unpaid) reviewers who frequently assisted in the forums and noticed recurring issues in concept threads that would make them uninterested in or hesitant towards assisting authors. As oftentimes said issues were due more to lack of familiarity with the writing process rather than intentional laziness or malicious intent to make reviewers do the heavy lifting during the writing process, the template was made to preemptively make newer authors in particular more aware of what reviewers are looking for in a post they would be interested in responding to. If you feel that the template is in need of revision, you can make a post with your recommended changes in the Policy forum: <a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/forum/c-51015/proposals-and-policy">http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/forum/c-51015/proposals-and-policy</a></p>
