<p>Hello, I actually jojned last month, but it took this long to figure out the work around for Chrome. Now that I'm here I have a few ideas, some are random SCP articles(which I will provide a brief list of in order to get feedback on which one you'd like to see first) and I want to introduce an OC to lay the groundwork for a movie and TV series. The OC is not going to be it's own SCP, rather it will be adapted from SCP-2806, specifically an arm that can double force/strength and has a retractable aramid covering. The individual this is attached to, SCP-2806-21A, is permitted to keep the arm in exchange for working for the Foundation as a member of MTF Alpha-9, an offer made when it managed to survive a security breach involving SCP-682 and actually helped recontain it. I need to figure out how to add an addendum to put this in, unless someone can explain the process better to me. The SCP article addendum would only include a description of the new instance, updated containment procedures and an interview between SCP-2806-21A and the agent that brought him in, other details will follow in tales that would connect to the Ressurection Canon, and by the nature of SCP-2806, create crossover with Those Twisted Pines.</p>
